# Copy to secrets.env (gitignored) and put realm credentials here, one KEY=value
# per line. Both compose files load the whole file into the container, so a realm
# that declares `token-env: SOME_KEY` in its apis.yml works the moment the key is
# on a line here — no compose edit, nothing to commit.
#
# This file is the example and holds no secrets. secrets.env holds nothing BUT
# secrets: no quoting, no ${...} interpolation — values pass through verbatim.
# Restart the container after editing; environment is read at start.
#
# ODOO_API_KEY=...        # realm-odoo — an Odoo user API key
# DIFFBOT_TOKEN=...       # realm-diffbot — diffbot.com API token
